  "announcement_is_prerelease": false,
  "announcement_title": "0.0.70 - 2026-10-16",
  "announcement_changelog": "### Fixed\n\n- Pasmo programs that cross `$FFFF`, including negative `DEFS` counts, now\n  produce the native wrapped memory image with correct labels, entry points\n  and debug addresses. Tape output rejects images that cannot fit a block\n  before replacing an existing file. ([#710](https://github.com/asm198x/asm198x/pull/710))\n- SjASMPlus accepts uppercase and lowercase word expression operators with its\n  native precedence and logical `NOT`, while preserving Pasmo's distinct rules.\n  ([#711](https://github.com/asm198x/asm198x/pull/711))\n- SjASMPlus double-quoted data decodes native backslash escapes and preserves\n  escaped delimiters, packed word/wide values and marked or terminated strings.\n  Formatting retains the same bytes; malformed input preserves prior output.\n  ([#713](https://github.com/asm198x/asm198x/pull/713))",
  "announcement_github_body": "## Release Notes\n\n### Fixed\n\n- Pasmo programs that cross `$FFFF`, including negative `DEFS` counts, now\n  produce the native wrapped memory image with correct labels, entry points\n  and debug addresses. Tape output rejects images that cannot fit a block\n  before replacing an existing file. ([#710](https://github.com/asm198x/asm198x/pull/710))\n- SjASMPlus accepts uppercase and lowercase word expression operators with its\n  native precedence and logical `NOT`, while preserving Pasmo's distinct rules.\n  ([#711](https://github.com/asm198x/asm198x/pull/711))\n- SjASMPlus double-quoted data decodes native backslash escapes and preserves\n  escaped delimiters, packed word/wide values and marked or terminated strings.\n  Formatting retains the same bytes; malformed input preserves prior output.\n  ([#713](https://github.com/asm198x/asm198x/pull/713))\n\n## Install asm198x 0.0.70\n\n### Install prebuilt binaries via shell script\n\n```sh\ncurl --proto '=https' --tlsv1.2 -LsSf https://github.com/asm198x/asm198x/releases/download/asm198x-v0.0.70/asm198x-installer.sh | sh\n```\n\n### Install prebuilt binaries via powershell script\n\n```sh\npowershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -c \"irm https://github.com/asm198x/asm198x/releases/download/asm198x-v0.0.70/asm198x-installer.ps1 | iex\"\n```\n\n### Install prebuilt binaries via Homebrew\n\n```sh\nbrew install asm198x/tap/asm198x\n```\n\n## Download asm198x 0.0.70\n\n|  File  | Platform | Checksum |\n|--------|----------|----------|\n| [asm198x-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.xz](https://github.com/asm198x/asm198x/releases/download/asm198x-v0.0.70/asm198x-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.xz) | Apple Silicon macOS | [checksum](https://github.com/asm198x/asm198x/releases/download/asm198x-v0.0.70/asm198x-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.xz.sha256) |\n| [asm198x-x86_64-apple-darwin.tar.xz](https://github.com/asm198x/asm198x/releases/download/asm198x-v0.0.70/asm198x-x86_64-apple-darwin.tar.xz) | Intel macOS | [checksum](https://github.com/asm198x/asm198x/releases/download/asm198x-v0.0.70/asm198x-x86_64-apple-darwin.tar.xz.sha256) |\n| [asm198x-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.zip](https://github.com/asm198x/asm198x/releases/download/asm198x-v0.0.70/asm198x-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.zip) | x64 Windows | [checksum](https://github.com/asm198x/asm198x/releases/download/asm198x-v0.0.70/asm198x-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.zip.sha256) |\n| [asm198x-aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz](https://github.com/asm198x/asm198x/releases/download/asm198x-v0.0.70/asm198x-aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz) | ARM64 Linux | [checksum](https://github.com/asm198x/asm198x/releases/download/asm198x-v0.0.70/asm198x-aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz.sha256) |\n| [asm198x-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz](https://github.com/asm198x/asm198x/releases/download/asm198x-v0.0.70/asm198x-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz) | x64 Linux | [checksum](https://github.com/asm198x/asm198x/releases/download/asm198x-v0.0.70/asm198x-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz.sha256) |\n\n",
